    <bpmn:process id="W_W1214" name="W1214. Store Performance Scorecard Weekly Review &amp; Regional Benchmarking" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Scheduled — weekly (every Monday); system auto-generates scorecard from prior week&#x27;s data
Frequency: Weekly
Volume: 200 stores × 52 weeks = 10,400 scorecards/year; ~6 Regional Manager reviews/week (one per RM, per profile §12.1)
Owner: Regional Manager
Participants: Regional Manager, Store Managers (in region), BI Analyst (dashboard maintenance), VP Store Operations (monthly consolidation)
Source: workflow W1214 — Store Performance Scorecard Weekly Review &amp; Regional Benchmarking</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W1214_LaneSet5">
        <bpmn:lane id="W1214_Lane1" name="System">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1214_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1214_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1214_Task9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1214_Start6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W1214_Lane2" name="Regional Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1214_Task10</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1214_Task11</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1214_Task12</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W1214_Lane3" name="VP Store Operations">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1214_Task13</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W1214_Lane4" name="BI Analyst">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1214_Task14</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1214_End15</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W1214_Start6" name="Scheduled — weekly (every Monday); system auto-generates scorecard from prior week&#x27;s data">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1214_Flow18</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W1214_Task7" name="Weekly Store Performance Scorecard">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: System auto-generates Weekly Store Performance Scorecard overnight Sunday/Monday for each store with prior week metrics: (a) Revenue: weekly revenue vs. target, year-over-year growth, revenue per sqm, average transaction value; (b) Productivity: revenue per employee, transactions per labor hour; (c) Inventory: inventory turns, out-of-stock rate (from W42 cycle count data), shrinkage estimate; (d) Customer: CSAT score (from W65 surveys), loyalty scan rate, BOPIS fulfillment SLA compliance; (e) Operations: on-time store opening rate, receiving accuracy, planogram compliance per W86
Responsible (R): System
Accountable (A): —
Duration: Automated</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1214_Flow18</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1214_Flow18</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W1214_Task8" name="regional rankings">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: System calculates regional rankings: stores ranked within their region on each KPI; color-coded: green (top quartile), yellow (middle 50%), red (bottom quartile); stores that moved &gt; 10 percentile positions week-over-week flagged as &quot;movers&quot;
Responsible (R): System
Accountable (A): —
Duration: Automated</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1214_Flow19</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1214_Flow19</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W1214_Task9" name="exception alerts">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: System identifies exception alerts: (a) revenue decline &gt; 10% week-over-week without seasonal explanation, (b) out-of-stock rate &gt; 5% for any major category, (c) shrinkage estimate &gt; 2% of revenue, (d) CSAT score &lt; 75%, (e) loyalty scan rate &lt; 40%, (f) any KPI in bottom quartile for 3+ consecutive weeks (chronic underperformer)
Responsible (R): System
Accountable (A): —
Duration: Automated</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1214_Flow20</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1214_Flow20</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1214_Task10" name="Regional Manager opens scorecard dashboard Monday morning; reviews: (a)…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: Regional Manager opens scorecard dashboard Monday morning; reviews: (a) region-level summary: total revenue vs. target, store count in green/yellow/red, key movers; (b) each store&#x27;s scorecard with exception alerts; (c) identifies 3–5 stores requiring attention (new red stores, declining trends, chronic underperformers)
Responsible (R): Regional Manager
Accountable (A): VP Store Operations
Duration: 30–60 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1214_Flow21</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1214_Flow21</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1214_Task11" name="coaching call">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 5: Regional Manager contacts flagged Store Managers: (a) coaching call for declining stores — understand root cause (new competitor, staff turnover, supply issues, local event), agree on corrective actions; (b) recognition call for top movers — acknowledge improvement, ask what&#x27;s working; (c) documents call notes and action items in store operations module
Responsible (R): Regional Manager
Accountable (A): —
Duration: 15–30 min per flagged store</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1214_Flow22</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1214_Flow22</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1214_Task12" name="Weekly regional team huddle">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 6: Weekly regional team huddle (Monday afternoon): Regional Manager shares: (a) region performance vs. other regions (VP Store Operations shares inter-regional comparison), (b) top-performing stores and their best practices, (c) common challenges and cross-store solutions, (d) upcoming initiatives and priorities for the week
Responsible (R): Regional Manager
Accountable (A): VP Store Operations
Duration: 30 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1214_Flow23</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1214_Flow23</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1214_Task13" name="Monthly consolidation">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 7: Monthly consolidation: VP Store Operations reviews aggregated scorecard data: (a) compare 10 regions on same KPIs, (b) identify best- and worst-performing regions, (c) analyze trends: are chain-wide KPIs improving or declining?, (d) present monthly summary to CEO/COO with recommendations for capital allocation, new store prioritization, or operational interventions
Responsible (R): VP Store Operations
Accountable (A): COO
Duration: 2–3 hours/month</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1214_Flow24</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1214_Flow24</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1214_Task14" name="Quarterly KPI review">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 8: Quarterly KPI review: BI Analyst and VP Store Operations review scorecard KPIs: (a) are targets still appropriate?, (b) should new KPIs be added (e.g., ecommerce conversion rate, marketplace seller rating)?, (c) adjust regional grouping if store count changes with new store openings
Responsible (R): BI Analyst / VP Store Operations
Accountable (A): CIO
Duration: 2 hours/quarter</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1214_Flow25</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W1214_End15" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W1214_Flow26</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W1214_Annotation16">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-325 (ensure controlled execution — BI Platform &amp; Reporting (PA-28.1).) | - operational: Regional Manager review and approval gate
Owner: Regional Manager</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W1214_Assoc17" sourceRef="W1214_Annotation16" targetRef="W1214_Start6" associationDirection="None" />
